2 CONT Obituary for Wicksell, Larry J in loving memory, 5/19/41 to 12/6/07.  Born in Wenatchen, Washington.  Moved to Ft. Lauderdale as a child.  He graduated from Ft. Lauderdale High School in 1959.  Mr. Wicksell served his country for 
2 CONC 5 years in the Air Force.  After his service years he was an excellent piano technician for 40 years.  Larry is survived by his loving wife Martha ; stepparents Gladys & Ralph Artler; three daughters, Tara Lyn Paquin (husband Gary
2 CONC ) Janel Starnes (husband Joel) and Lynn Ingram (husband Joe).  He also raised his stepdaughter Gail Perry Mason (husband Lance)   Mr. Wicksell was also blessed with 8 grandchildren and several nieces and nephews.  Larry is going t
2 CONC o join his father and mother Carl E Wicksell and Dorothy Rushing and brother Byron Wicksell who preceded him in death.  Services will be held today, Sat. Dec. 8, 2007 @ Forest Lawn Funeral Home  Viewing 3-4 PM  Service at 4 PM
