1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.google.com/maps/place/836+93+Korsmyrbr%C3%A4nna/@63.4230097,13.0114517,7z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x466fe6cc1e2a7833:0xe4f84e74d87e72a1!8m2!3d63.4230276!4d15.2528
