1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The original "Brudscrift" as shown in the photograph is located in the folk museum called  Gammelgården in Sveg, Sweden in their house called Nygården. 
2 CONT
2 CONT English translation of Brudscrift/Bride script/Marriage:
2 CONT
2 CONT Congratulations and to honor the memory of the honorable wedding couple
2 CONT
2 CONT Former lay assessor (judge assistant and evaluates property for taxation) and farmer well respected and sensible Per Jonasson
2 CONT
2 CONT The maid virgin and chaste the same 
2 CONT  Karin Jonasdotter
2 CONT
2 CONT Both of them living in Glissjoberg village.  The wedding day was celebrated year 1839:  on 26 December 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Poem at the bottom)
2 CONT
2 CONT Congratulation wishes to your happiness        All your life Friendship always be in your home Blessings will fall down like rain on your table Your days go away the soul stays on a higher level (heaven) This is the wish of the fr
2 CONC iends of the wedding of both grownups and small ones
