2 CONT Mattias Theodor, som barn:
2 CONT HFL 1814-1815 Ökne?
2 CONT https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0033552_00210#?c=&m=&s=&cv=209&xywh=292%2C3953%2C1537%2C956
2 CONT -----
2 CONT His birth is recorded as Matthias Theodor born 16 Dec 1812, parents tailor Matts Norlander and wife Juliana Ersdotter (age 40) in Böle. 
2 CONT FB:
2 CONT AD Stöde C:2 (1773-1847) Image 80 / page 151 (AID: v122473.b80.s151, NAD: SE/HLA/1010189).
2 CONT -----
2 CONT Bor: '''Fanbyn 1''', 1816-1823:
2 CONT https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0033552_00053#?c=&m=&s=&cv=52&xywh=274%2C35%2C2661%2C1532
2 CONT -----
2 CONT I Fanbyn 1, Mattias Teodor gift 1833, dotter Juliana född 1834, död 1834. 
2 CONT Mathias Theodor, born 1812-12-16, married 1833. - wife Märta Lisa Nordell, born 1812-04-23. - d. Juliana, born 1834-01-03, died 1834-01-06.
2 CONT HFL:
2 CONT AD Stöde AI:8 (1833-1842) Image 60 / page 51 (AID: v122459.b60.s51, NAD: SE/HLA/1010189)
2 CONT
2 CONT They move 1834/1835 to page 62, still at Fanbyn (troligen 8?), '''it seems they switched places with Erik Norlander/Nordlander b1802, Mattias Theodors brother.'''
2 CONT https://app.arkivdigital.se/volume/v122459?image=71&page=51
2 CONT http://www.arkivdigital.se/aid/show/v122459.b71.s62
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Teori:
2 CONT Mattias Teodor f 1812 är yngre, gifter sig 1833, bor kvar hos fadern till 1834. När äldre brodern Erik f 1802 tar över faderns hemman Fanbyn 1 (Skräddar-Mats ) 1834, då köper Mattias Teodor hemman/mark, (Dalhem, Fanbyn 8), Erik är
2 CONC  skyldig Mattias Teodor 400 riksdaler hans arvslott efter fadern Skräddar-Mats.'''
2 CONT Köper del av Fanbyn 8 av broder Erik ? Fel/konstigt. Köper hela 8:6. Har Erik något kvar av fanbyn 8?
2 CONT Köper jord av sin bror? Fel/konstigt uttryckt. Köpte helt hemman med hus och allt.
2 CONT ------
2 CONT The daughter's birth is recorded as Juliana Martha born 6 Apr 1841, parents farmer Maths Norlander and wife Martha Lisa Nordell (age 29) of Fanbyn. 
2 CONT HFL:
2 CONT AD Stöde C:2 (1773-1847) Image 161 / page 313 (AID: v122473.b161.s313, NAD: SE/HLA/1010189).
2 CONT -----
2 CONT - farmer Mathias Th. Nordlader, born 1812-12-16, married 1833. - wife Märta Lisa Nordell, born 1812-04-23. - s. Mathias, born 1835-12-06, died 1835. - d. Engla Mathilda, born 1837-08-26. - d. Juliana Martha, born 1841-04-06.
2 CONT -----
2 CONT Then in 
2 CONT AD Stöde AI:9 (1843-1850) Image 72 / page 64 (AID: v122460.b72.s64, NAD: SE/HLA/1010189):
