2 CONC 44-05-31 Stöde. - s. Eric Alexander, born 1847-09-22 Stöde.
2 CONT -----
2 CONT '''At Fanbyn number 8'''
2 CONT AD Stöde AI:10 (1851-1860) Image 104 / page 83 (AID: v122461.b104.s83, NAD: SE/HLA/1010189):
2 CONT
2 CONT - farmer Math.Theodor Nordlander, born 1812-12-16 Stöde, married 1833, died 1858-08-13. - wife Marta L. Nordell, born 1812-04-23 Borgsjö. - d. Ängla Math., born 1837-08-26 Stöde, moved to page 248. - d. Juliana Märta, born 1841-04
2 CONC -06 Stöde, moved 1836 to page 277. - s. Pehr Mathias, born 1844-05-31 Stöde. - s. Eric Aleksander, born 1847-09-22 Stöde. - d. Lisa Stina, born 1852-07(?)-16 Stöde.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The nephew Mathias Alexander Norlander b.1832 takes over as farmer in 1858/1859 when Mattias Theodor b.1812 dies  in 1858.'''
