1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''1.12 Hanna Josefina Andersdotter'''. Farmer's wife in Kroksta no. 3 in 1917. Born 1880-12-05 Pengsjö, Vännäs fs. Resident from 1902-11-15 Själevads fs (Y). Married to Johan Strandberg 1904-10-28 Själevads fs (Y)
2 CONC . Resident until 1906-11-27 Arnäs fs (Y). Resident from 1906-11-27 Kroksta, Själevads fs. Died 1945-04-14 Kroksta, Själevads fs.Sömmerska/worker in Pengsjö on the homestead. Moves to Kroksta in Själevads fs in 1902. Married in Arn
2 CONC äs in 1904. Then moved into Kroksta no. 3 in 1906 where the husband becomes a homesteader and farmer. The home net is at 9 1/2 sel. Had two more children who died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
